# INFEELIT — CURSOR RULES

## Remotes (permanent)
Two remotes are configured:
- origin = infeelit-c005e3b3 (mirror, for PRs and history)
- prod = infeelit-app (Vercel production)

After every successful build, ALWAYS push to both:
  git push origin HEAD
  git push prod HEAD:main
Never push to only one. Production is infeelit-app, not infeelit-c005e3b3.

## Branch Strategy
ALWAYS work directly on the main branch.
NEVER create new branches like cursor/xxx.
Before any change: git checkout main && git pull origin main
After each fix: git add . && git commit -m "fix: description"
After every successful build, push both remotes as above.

## Scope
Only modify files explicitly mentioned in the prompt.
Never modify other files without asking.
